dn.com/content/v1/61e216d0c5eb655d911b5ec0/1748627787699-N8X0PEJECN21IUA3TMR4/pickleball.jpg?format=2500w","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":13}]},{"name":"Cooking class","desc":null,"photo":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/61e216d0c5eb655d911b5ec0/fb05749e-f119-4cb1-bd14-3b50bad513e3/370089993_351493260743247_3396266222312587509_n.jpg?format=2500w","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":14}]},{"name":"Guided Fishing Charters","desc":"Sandspit / K’il Kun, Haida GwaiiAugust 28 - September 2, 2026Hosted by Sandspit Adventures & Hekate’s Retreat After last year's incredible success, we're bringing back the Salmon & Tuna Derby - the ultimate way to close out the 2026 fishing season on Haida Gwaii, one of the most remote and spectacular coastlines in Canada. Target trophy salmon and longfin tuna in the pristine waters at the \"edge of the world.\" Whether you're an experienced angler bringing your own boat or looking to charter one of our boats with qualified captains, this derby offers world-class fishing, incredible camaraderie, and the chance to land the fish of a lifetime. Haida Gwaii delivers late-season action like","photo":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/61e216d0c5eb655d911b5ec0/47f96823-2532-4544-a7c8-0846af486d79/55138900685_d774aa0866_c.jpg?format=2500w","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":15}]}],"includes":[],"addons":[],"gap":"Prices, hours and eligibility are not copied here yet. We will ask when you request.","blurb":"With a modern, contemporary lay-out, these cabins are the ideal place to retreat to after a long day of adventures.","photos":[],"ytVideos":[],"lat":53.2435889,"lon":-131.8115356,"tags":["Nordic Sauna","Fairway Cabins","RV Rentals","RV Sites & Camping","Haida Gwaii Kayak","Green Fees","Memberships","Golf Cart Rentals (18+ to drive)","Pickleball Courts","Cooking class","Guided Fishing Charters","Sauna session"],"highlights":[],"requirements":[],"groupInfo